{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "08c9a98e-26cc-8008-9a39-017b373f2dc9",
  "created_at": "2026-01-18T12:20:46-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carol Hazard",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:17:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:17:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Denise! Great, somebody's there. I wasn't sure anyone would pick up on a Sunday, since City Hall's closed and all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:18:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The storm line stays open on weekends. What can I help you with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:18:10-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful. So, the plow came through this morning, and I know it's only a dusting out there, it's freezing but there's barely any snow, and they still managed to bury the end of my driveway. It's a wall of snow, packed hard, right across the whole opening!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:18:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's the worst. The plow pushes everything off the street right into the apron."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:18:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly! And with this cold it's going to turn to concrete. I'd love for a plow to come back and just, you know, clear that spot or at least knock it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:18:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can put in a request for the crew to take another look. What street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:18:53-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, um, I'd rather not give the address on this call, I'm actually calling for my neighbor. She's not on the phone much. But I can give you my number, it's 401-555-0197."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:19:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I have that number. I do need the street for the crew to find it, though. Is it a main road or a side street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:19:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great question! Side street. Little one, a dead end."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:19:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'll note it as a dead end side street with a call-back number, and dispatch can phone you for the exact location. Did the plow come by just once this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:19:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just once, around seven I think. And the neighbor said they're not supposed to plow for dustings, so she was pretty annoyed. Is there a rule? Like under thirty?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:19:42-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thirty? No, I think you mean thirteen. Sorry, hang on, I mean there's no inch rule I can quote you. Crews go out when roads are icy, too, and with the cold snap they were salting and plowing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:19:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait, thirteen? Not thirty? Okay, thirteen, got it! Wow, I was way off. Great, so it was the ice, then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:20:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, and let me be clear, I wasn't giving you a number for snow depth. Just that the cold made the roads a priority. I'll send the request over now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:20:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful. And will somebody come today, do you think?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:20:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't promise a time. Crews are on a Sunday schedule, but it'll go on the list, and they'll call you if they need more detail."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:20:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, great! That's all I can ask. Thank you, Denise!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:20:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Stay warm, and tell your neighbor to chip at it a little in the afternoon sun if she can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T12:20:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, I'll tell her! Thanks, bye!"
    }
  ],
